Description:You are at 29 life and control Serra Ascendant (1/1 lifelink; +5/+5 and flying at 30 or more life). The opponent controls an untapped Stoic Builder (2/3). End the turn at 30 life with Serra Ascendant on the battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-3f5c3e49f1dc47e8 | Combat damage and lifelink's life gain happen at once (CR 510.2, 702.15b), so Serra Ascendant is already 6/6 when state-based actions are checked
